          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: বিমান",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বিমান — bimān — \"an aeroplane\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বিমান (bimān) is Sanskrit vimāna, \"car of the gods\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama (CDIAL 11823). In Bengali it has come to mean \"aeroplane\"."
            }
          ]
        },
